  "updated_at": "2026-03-27",
  "bio": "Odysseus is a masterful tattoo artist based in Berkley, United States, who specializes in the dynamic and vibrant watercolor style. Known for their attention to detail and color blending prowess, their work captures the fluidity and ethereal qualities that watercolor tattoos are famed for. Clients appreciate not only the high level of skill that Odysseus brings to each piece but also the immaculate cleanliness maintained in the studio, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience for every tattoo session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berkley, Michigan, United States"
}